  "enable": "BV 110 EnLocalAdjustment allows or blocks occupant changes to setpoints, Eco, Boost and On/Off on the unit.",
  "heartbeat": "AV 130 BusWatchdog, 30-3600 s (default 120 s), is for monitoring only; the document gives no fail action.",
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "MS/TP: baud 9600-115200, default 38400; MAC address 0-127, default 1; max 32 nodes without repeater.",
